; rc1 network acceptance: three package roots of their own, each for one
; window. SYS:RcNet and SYS:RcEnt start empty; SYS:RcTls holds the local
; index made by make-tls-index.py. The windows are started by the driver.
Failat 21
Protect RAM:rxt/PkgManager +e
Protect RAM:rxt/PkgManager-entropyfail +e
Protect RAM:rxt/apkg +e
Delete SYS:RcNet ALL FORCE QUIET
Delete SYS:RcTls ALL FORCE QUIET
Delete SYS:RcEnt ALL FORCE QUIET
MakeDir SYS:RcNet
MakeDir SYS:RcNet/db
MakeDir SYS:RcNet/cache
MakeDir SYS:RcTls
MakeDir SYS:RcTls/db
MakeDir SYS:RcTls/cache
MakeDir SYS:RcEnt
MakeDir SYS:RcEnt/db
MakeDir SYS:RcEnt/cache
Copy RAM:rxt/TLSIDX SYS:RcTls/db/index.json
